    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH2a1468-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Courage is the decisiveness of righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">yì zhī jué yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Metal can cut and sever,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">making it the decisiveness of righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Without decisiveness and courage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">one cannot achieve righteousness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">A complexion that is even and smooth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">is called penetrating subtlety;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">penetrating subtlety</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">is the source of wisdom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Water flowing freely and reaching everywhere</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">is the source of wisdom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Without a source penetrating subtlety,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">one cannot achieve wisdom.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">The five qualities are constant in nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">therefore they are called the Five Constants.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">The Five Things</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">are the constant energies of Heaven and Earth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">the Five Virtues</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-3a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">are the constant actions of humans and things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">The distinctions of the Five Constants</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">are arranged as the Five Virtues:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">therefore, being warm and upright yet yielding and resolute</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">is the virtue of Wood.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Being warm without uprightness is weakness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">being yielding without resoluteness is timidity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:16:34.317+09:00">Being firm and solid yet broad and resolute</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">金 jīn zhī dé yě; This is the virtue of metal;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">剛 gāng ér bù sāi zé jué, If it is rigid but not obstructed, it will be decisive;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">弘 hóng ér bù yì zé quē. If it is expansive but not resolute, it will be flawed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">愿 yuàn gōng ér lǐ jìng, Being sincere and respectful, managing with reverence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">水 shuǐ zhī dé yě; This is the virtue of water;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">愿 yuàn ér bù gōng zé bèi, If it is sincere but not respectful, it is perverse;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">理 lǐ ér bù jìng zé luàn. If it is managed but without reverence, it is chaotic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">寬 kuān lì ér róu lì, Being broad and dignified, gentle and established,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">土 tǔ zhī dé yě; This is the virtue of earth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">寬 kuān ér bù lì zé màn, If it is broad but not dignified, it is negligent;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">柔 róu ér bù lì zé sàn. If it is gentle but not established, it is scattered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">簡 jiǎn chàng ér míng biān, Being concise and smooth, clear and incisive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">火 huǒ zhī dé yě. This is the virtue of fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">簡 jiǎn ér bù chàng zé zhì, If it is concise but not smooth, it is stagnant;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">明 míng ér bù biān zé yì. If it is clear but not incisive, it is obscured.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">雖 suī tǐ biàn wú qióng, Although transformations are infinitely varied,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">猶 yóu yī hū wǔ zhì. They still depend on the five elements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">人 rén qíng wàn huà, Human emotions undergo myriad transformations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">bù kě shèng jí. Which are impossible to fully comprehend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">尋 xún cháng jìng yuán, Seeking their common origin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">cháng zài yú wǔ. It always lies in the five elements.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">故 gù qí gāng róu míng chàng zhēn gù zhī zhēng, Therefore, the signs of rigidity, gentleness, clarity, smoothness, uprightness, and firmness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">著 zhù hū xíng róng, Are evident in physical appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">見 jiàn hū shēng sè, Are seen in sounds and colors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">發 fā hū qíng wèi, Are expressed in emotions and feelings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">各 gè rú qí xiàng. Each according to its form.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">自然 zì rán zhī lǐ, The principles of nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:18:42.077+09:00">神 shén dòng xíng sè. Spiritual movement affects physical appearance and color.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Chéng fā yú zhōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">and virtuous brilliance shines outward.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Therefore, if the heart's nature is bright and upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the demeanor will be firm and resolute.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">If the heart's nature is excellent and decisive,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the demeanor will be forward and vigorous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">If the heart's nature is balanced and reasonable,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the demeanor will be peaceful and leisurely.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Now, demeanor in motion forms appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">and each has its own attitude:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the movement of an upright appearance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">is outstanding and proper;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the movement of an excellent appearance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">is diligent and composed;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the movement of a virtuous appearance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-4a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">is respectful and dignified.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Now, the movements of the appearance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">originate from the heart's vital energy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">When the heart's vital energy is within,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">the appearance is seen without.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">The evidence of the heart's vital energy</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">is the changes in sound.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">If the heart is not fixated on one thing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">then even harmonious sounds will change.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Now, vital energy combines to form sound,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">and sound corresponds to the lǜ and lǚ musical scales:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">that which is clear and bright is *lǜ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">that which is harmonious and balanced is *lǚ*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">There are sounds of peace and harmony,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">there are sounds of clarity and fluency,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">there are sounds of resonance and extension.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">Because the heart's vital energy is not the same,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2a1468_CHANT_002-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-04T16:21:06.193+09:00">therefore the sounds emitted are also different.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
